{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "_doc": [
    "Single machine-readable source for path classification (AGENTS.md 'Atomare Commit-Gruppen' + preflight scope).",
    "Readers: scripts/preflight_v2/change_impact_resolver.gd (via constraint_scanner.path_contracts), scripts/commit_group_guard.sh, docs/reference/python_preflight/scope.py.",
    "Semantics: rules are ordered, FIRST MATCH WINS for the guard; the resolver unions contracts of all matching rules (breadth for tests).",
    "Every rule carries BOTH 'contracts' (preflight scope) and 'groups' (commit atomicity).",
    "Special group values: \"AUTO\" = auto-managed ride-along (mask 0, never classified); \"ALL_DOMAINS\" = preflight.gd multi-domain mask.",
    "A file matching NO rule is unknown: the resolver fails closed (unknown_impact); the guard FAILS the commit (no free ride on mask 0)."
  ],
  "groups": [
    "transit",
    "navigation",
    "planets",
    "game_state",
    "ships",
    "combat",
    "world",
    "sectors",
    "save",
    "concept",
    "global_search",
    "doki",
    "narrative"
  ],
  "rules": [
